  - cybersecurity
  - any.run
  - dynamic analysis
abstract: >
  RanDe-W11 is a balanced behavioral dataset of 2,000 Windows executable samples
  (1,000 ransomware across 30 families, 1,000 benign) dynamically analyzed using the
  Any.run interactive sandbox in a Windows 11 environment. The dataset comprises
  103 behavioral features organized into nine domains and is intended for
  machine learning-based ransomware detection and family classification research.
